    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88046" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προμνήστ-ρια</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>woman who woos</i> or
				<i>courts for another, matchmaker,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				41
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				149d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DDeor.</u>
				20.16
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ κακῶν π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hipp.</u>
					589
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προμνηστρίας</span> is prob. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ίδας</span> in <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				2.6.36
			</span></i>.</div>
